Rule 9 (when input and exponent tensors have identical shapes, out must match that shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) then ndim(v_3) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_3, i) = shape(v_1, i)
